name>Jones</surname><given-names>IF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Exploring the gap: community pharmacists&#x02019; perceptions of their current role compared with their aspirations</article-title><source>Int J Pharm Pract</source><year>2000</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>204</fpage><lpage>8</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Rutter PM, Hunt AJ, Jones IF. Exploring the gap: community pharmacists&#x02019; perceptions of their current role compared with their aspirations. Int J Pharm Pract 2000;8:204&#x02013;8. </citation></ref><ref id="CR28"><label>28.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mobach</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>From the laboratory to pharmaceutical care research</article-title><source>Pharm World Sci</source><year>2001</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>205</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/A:1014518827138</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Mobach MP. From the laboratory to pharmaceutical care research. Pharm World Sci 2001;23:205&#x02013;9. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11826508</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR29"><label>29.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mobach</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pharmaceutical care research, hard or soft?</article-title><source>Pharm World Sci</source><year>2002</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>4</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/A:1014888811209</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Mobach MP. Pharmaceutical care research, hard or soft? Pharm World Sci 2002;24:1&#x02013;4. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11980168</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR30"><label>30.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bos</sur